{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel the nostalgia!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside a typical Polish apartment block from the 90s. Behind the thin walls lurks more than just neighbors with power drills. This is a place where absurdity collides with horror, and everyday life turns into a nightmare laced with dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends a retro pixel-art style with Lumen\u2019s realistic lighting, creating a visual effect that feels both familiar and deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, shiver, and question your own choices \u2014 because here, the line between comedy and tragedy barely exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016720/extras/39a9bb3618067a29c6989f8c9cf56a94.poster.avif?t=1774641680\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016720/extras/39a9bb3618067a29c6989f8c9cf56a94.webm?t=1774641680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Polish story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 120 minutes of gameplay (Perfect for a YouTube gameplay!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of a typical Polish apartment block</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark humor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p cl